Z||000000||AL||03-23-2000||07:43 PM||||<BR>well today i finnaly went to see if icould find the place, i did,i met phill a very nice gentleman, i asked if they sell parts and stuff and to my surprice we talked of these little cars for a while he even showed me inside the place and showed me those new fiero headers, i was impressed that this man would treat me like if he new me from a long time ago.he finnaly told me how much it was to be a member, well after this visit i'm sure i will be a member soon, to all who haven't met this man you won't find a more gentle and friendly man, i guess it's true! all fiero people are the nicest folks you will find.||||reg||14
